CandleThrottled (Too many requests): back off and retry the same window later
CandleAuthenticationError (Session Expired): stop this broker
CandleBlocked (error code: 1015): stop this broker
CandleInstrumentUnknown (invalid token): retire the series
CandleError (the broker answered in a shape no parser knows): record a candle failure against the series
ValueError (could not convert string to float): record an unexpected failure against the series
